  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0068_3ea00516d6fd.png\" style=\"width: 387px; height: 300px;\" /></p><p>Here, we can see from the above diagram&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>{</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>}</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>Similarly <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>Relation from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>p</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn></math></p>"
